  "content": "<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Tam Giao House was conceived around the \"Tam Giao\" philosophy, with three core values guiding the design process:</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Harmony between old and new.</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">The interplay of light, wind, and water.</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Harmony among people.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">The project seeks to create a living environment that balances architecture, nature, and people, where every family member can connect with one another and with their surroundings.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>"
